This project provided practical exposure to the early stages of an ASIC implementation flow.

### Key concepts explored:

* 🏗️ SoC module hierarchy
* 📝 RTL hardware description
* 🧪 RTL functional verification
* ⚙️ Logic synthesis
* 🧹 Logic optimization
* 🔄 Flip-flop technology mapping
