* 🏭 SKY130 libraries
* 📦 Gate-level netlists
* 🔬 Post-synthesis simulation
* 📈 Waveform-based verification
* 🔍 RTL vs synthesized-design comparison
* ⏱️ Functional vs timing-aware GLS

---

# 🎯 Main Learning

> **RTL describes the intended hardware behavior, while synthesis transforms that description into an optimized network of cells belonging to a specific semiconductor technology.**

The post-synthesis simulation then provides an important verification step to ensure that the synthesized implementation continues to exhibit the expected functionality.

